Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nUnified L3 Orchestration Layer (v10_9) — PURE CONTROL FLOW (META-AWARE, RESTORED)\n\nThis module provides the complete orchestration logic for the v10_9\nagentic architecture. It restores orchestration capabilities from v10_8:\n\n    • Dynamic DAGs with well-typed nodes.\n    • Parallel node execution with simple retry logic.\n    • Fallback-friendly orchestration.\n    • NodeResult metadata (status, timings, payload refs).\n    • Route trace logging and correction journal surfaces.\n\nwhile preserving strict L1–L5 separation:\n\n    • L1: planning only (PlanObject creation).\n    • L2: execution only (tools/LLMs, RAG, drafting, QA, safety eval).\n    • L3: control flow / orchestration only (this file).\n    • L4: state management only (StateAdapter, StatePatch, memory).\n    • L5: safety & policy only (SafetyEngine, PolicyEngine, Arbitration).\n\nAdditionally, L3 is now **META-aware** via `meta_profile`:\n\n    • routing_bias.prefer_fast:\n        – influences execution scheduling (parallel vs conservative).\n    • safety_bias.heightened_caution:\n        – biases toward conservative scheduling and error handling.\n    • safety_bias.human_review_important:\n        – surfaced in WorkflowState.metadata (for HIL routing).\n\nL3 DOES NOT:\n\n    • Perform planning (L1 cognition).\n    • Call tools or LLMs directly (L2 does).\n    • Own safety/policy decisions (L5).\n    • Mutate durable state except via L4.StateAdapter patches.\n')),
    ImportFrom(
      module='__future__',
      names=[
        alias(name='annotations')],
      level=0),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='asyncio')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='time')]),
    ImportFrom(
      module='dataclasses',
      names=[
        alias(name='dataclass'),
        alias(name='field')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Awaitable'),
        alias(name='Callable'),
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='List'),
        alias(name='Optional'),
        alias(name='Set'),
        alias(name='Tuple')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='models',
      names=[
        alias(name='PlanObject'),
        alias(name='ExecutionResult'),
        alias(name='WorkflowState'),
        alias(name='WorkflowPhase'),
        alias(name='NodeResult'),
        alias(name='NodeStatus'),
        alias(name='StatePatch'),
        alias(name='RouteTraceEntry'),
        alias(name='CorrectionJournalEntry')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='exceptions',
      names=[
        alias(name='ValidationError'),
        alias(name='WorkflowTimeoutError'),
        alias(name='ToolExecutionError')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
